 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? So, what do you do? About a third. That's about right. Sounds good. Lovely idea, and you could explore different lighting too. That would show the changes in leaf and the tree's overall health. The cafe series gives you a real project every time, which keeps motivation up. The album one sounds like it' give you a lot of ideas. The tree series would look lovely in an exhibition. I' lean toward the tree series, as it feels more original. Also, it would be nice to come back to the same spot each year, watching the tree grow.",
